# The Docker build context — the same allowlist as .gcloudignore, for a build
# run anywhere else (a laptop, a CI runner). Everything is out unless named,
# and what is named is exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs. Keep the two files
# in step: a COPY added to the Dockerfile needs a line in both.
*
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src
!build
src/__tests__
src/**/*.md
